{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4992","title":"Xiaomi Introduces REDMI Pad 2 Series: Immersive Entertainment, Now More Vibrant Than Ever","desc":"Xiaomi Corporation today unveiled REDMI Pad 2 and its 4G variant — entry-level entertainment tablets designed to bring upgraded features to a wider audience. ","view_cnt":"8164","like_cnt":"1","add_time":"1748944852","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/641_operatorx_operatorx_opx/03/06/2025/4a8ce17a56a399bbe26a739939d1af49.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, China, June 5th, 2025 \u003c/strong\u003e– Xiaomi Corporation (\"Xiaomi\" or the \"Group\"; stock code:1810), a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an Internet of Things (\"IoT\") platform at its core, today unveiled REDMI Pad 2 and its 4G variant — entry-level entertainment tablets designed to bring upgraded features to a wider audience. Featuring a high-definition display, robust battery life, powerful performance, and running on the latest Xiaomi HyperOS 2, REDMI Pad 2 Series delivers an immersive experience for everyday entertainment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/709_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/06/2025/658cfb9b0d3562c2da55fbeb8fc29341.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVivid visuals and rich sound built for everyday enjoyment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Series features an expansive 11-inch 2.5K display,¹ offering crystal-clear detail and vibrant colors for streaming, browsing, and casual gaming. With a pixel density of 274 ppi and a 90Hz AdaptiveSync refresh rate,² visuals stay exceptionally smooth even during fast-moving scenes. Featuring DC dimming and TÜV Rheinland certifications for Low Blue Light (Software Solution), Flicker Free, and Circadian Friendly, REDMI Pad 2 Series ensures all-day eye comfort. Complementing the display is a quad-speaker setup with Dolby Atmos® and Hi-Res Audio, delivering an immersive sound experience for music, movies, and games.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/978_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/06/2025/e25f7b89f601df51ecb4246a79f594ae.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless interaction with Xiaomi HyperOS 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowered by Xiaomi HyperOS 2, REDMI Pad 2 Series delivers a connected experience that integrates effortlessly across Xiaomi phones and tablets. With Xiaomi Interconnectivity features such as Call sync, Network sync, and Shared clipboard,³ the tablet enables more intuitive workflows and greater flexibility across screens. Call sync allows incoming phone calls to be answered directly on the tablet, allowing you to stay connected without switching devices. When Wi-Fi is unavailable, Network sync steps in, enabling quick access to your phone's hotspot with a single tap. Meanwhile, Shared clipboard makes it easier to copy and paste text and images between your phone and tablet, as though working on the same device. Together, these features streamline daily workflows and enhance cross-device convenience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/227_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/06/2025/daa71f004b3837698bcf8fa9259aba59.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable performance and mobility with a sleek design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEquipped with the MediaTek Helio G100-Ultra processor, REDMI Pad 2 Series delivers strong performance and an immersive experience for everyday entertainment. A massive 9000mAh (typ) battery supports long viewing sessions and extended use with fewer charging breaks. For those who need connectivity on the go, REDMI Pad 2 4G offers the same entertainment-focused experience, featuring dual SIM and dual 4G support.⁵ From watching shows during commutes to enjoying music or videos in outdoor settings, REDMI Pad 2 4G enables on-the-go access to content without relying on Wi-Fi. REDMI Pad 2 features a metal unibody design,⁴ offering users a sophisticated tactile experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/97_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/03/06/2025/b03b53365c1f24e1268c170336bec7ff.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories for greater versatility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Series supports key accessories that enhance its versatility for entertainment and creativity.⁶ REDMI Smart Pen offers a 60Hz refresh rate⁷ and millisecond-level low latency⁸ — delivering precise input for writing, sketching, and note-taking. Requiring just 10 grams of activation force,⁹ it enables a natural, pen-on-paper experience. Meanwhile, REDMI Pad 2 Cover adds 360° protection and supports smart wake and sleep functionality, while its adjustable stand ensures stable, hands-free viewing with added comfort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and availability¹⁶\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 is available in Graphite Gray, Mint Green, and Lavender Purple,¹⁰ with three variants 4GB+128GB, 6GB+128GB, and 8GB+256GB,¹¹ starting from EUR 199.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 4G is available in Graphite Gray and Mint Green,¹⁰ with three variants 4GB+128GB, 6GB+128GB, and 8GB+256GB,¹¹ starting from EUR 249.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images are available here:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/Eiqu5By0hxdOruwXSzPEdX0BxriPDbrIoPVgFsg7c_ejLw?e=BhSRnC\"\u003eRedmi Pad 2\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EnZPVv_kqAVLsaqc8H9SCq0BLdUUZOpPcYrbjh5TUvCMng?e=hSXktY\"\u003eRedmi Pad 2 4G\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Pad 2 and REDMI Pad 2 4G Quick Specs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Pad 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eREDMI Pad 2 4G\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e11-inch crystal-clear display¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e2.5K resolution (2560 x 1600), 274 ppi\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUp to 90Hz refresh rate²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrightness: 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (Outdoor mode)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1500:1 contrast ratio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor depth: 10-bit, 1.07 billion colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReading mode\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWet touch technology\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDC dimming\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution) Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e11-inch crystal-clear display¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e2.5K resolution (2560 x 1600), 274 ppi\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUp to 90Hz refresh rate²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrightness: 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (Outdoor mode)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1500:1 contrast ratio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColor depth: 10-bit, 1.07 billion colors\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReading mode\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWet touch technology\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDC dimming\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Software Solution) Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certified\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePerformance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMediaTek Helio G100-Ultra\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e6nm manufacturing process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCPU: A76+A55, 2xA76@2.2GHz+6xA55@2.0 GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGPU: Mali-G57 MC2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRAM: LPDDR4X, ROM: UFS 2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable configurations: 4GB+128GB / 6GB+128GB / 8GB+256GB¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 2TB expandable storage¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMediaTek Helio G100-Ultra\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e6nm manufacturing process\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCPU: A76+A55, 2xA76@2.2GHz+6xA55@2.0 GHz\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGPU: Mali-G57 MC2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRAM: LPDDR4X, ROM: UFS 2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAvailable configurations: 4GB+128GB / 6GB+128GB / 8GB+256GB¹¹\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupports up to 2TB expandable storage¹²\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCamera\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e8MP rear camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1/4\", 1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1/5\", 1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e8MP rear camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1/4\", 1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.0\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e5MP front camera\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e1/5\", 1.12μm pixel size\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ef/2.2\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuad speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDolby Atmos®\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHi-Res Audio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuad speakers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDolby Atmos®\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHi-Res Audio\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExperience\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 2³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi HyperOS 2³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWi-Fi 5¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBluetooth® 5.3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDual SIM dual 4G⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWi-Fi 5¹³\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBluetooth® 5.3\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDesign\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMetal unibody design⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors: Graphite Gray, Mint Green, and Lavender Purple¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 254.58mm x 166.04mm x 7.36mm¹⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeight: 510g¹⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eColors: Graphite Gray, Mint Green¹⁰\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 254.58mm x 166.04mm x 7.36mm¹⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeight: 519g¹⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e9000mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e18W fast charging (inbox 15W)¹⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e9000mAh (typ) battery\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e18W fast charging (inbox 15W)¹⁵\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUSB Type-C\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Smart Pen⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Cover⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Screen Protector⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-background-color=\"[object Object]\" style=\"background-color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Smart Pen⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Cover⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eREDMI Pad 2 Screen Protector⁶\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹ REDMI Pad 2 Series screen size is about 11 inches when measured diagonally. Viewable area is smaller due to the curved corners. Measurements between individual products may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e² Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 90Hz for supported apps and games. Please refer to the actual experience.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e³ Phones and tablets need to be upgraded to Xiaomi HyperOS 2 with Bluetooth and WLAN settings activated, log in to the same Xiaomi account, and make sure \"Settings-Xiaomi Interconnectivity\" is turned on. Availability of specific features, and services may vary depending on software version, apps and product model, please refer to the actual use.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁴ The unibody metal design refers specifically to the back cover of the product and does not include the camera deco, buttons, card slots, or other components.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁵ The actual use of 4G networks and frequency bands depends on local carrier deployment.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁶ Accessories sold separately, availability may vary by regions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁷ Test data comes from Xiaomi Internal Lab and was obtained in comprehensive simulated scenarios. Data may vary due to differences in testing environments, software versions, and other factors. Please refer to the actual product.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁸ Millisecond-grade ultra-low latency refers to performance achieved within Xiaomi's self-developed apps. Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Laboratory, actual result may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e⁹ 10g specifically refers to when the pen body is at a 90° angle to the screen.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁰ Color availability may vary between regions.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹¹ Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹² Expandable storage card sold separately.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹³ Wi-Fi 5 capability may vary based on regional availability and local network support. Wi-Fi connectivity (including Wi-Fi frequency bands, Wi-Fi standards and other features as ratified in IEEE Standard 802.11 specifications) may vary based on regional availability and local network support. The function may be added via OTA when and where applicable.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁴ Data tested in Xiaomi Internal Labs, actual results may vary.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁵ Availability of in-box power adapter may vary by region, please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e¹⁶ Prices for different markets may vary due to VAT, taxes, and other factors.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: center\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENDS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/a\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of \"Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users' hearts\", Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world's leading smartphone companies. In March 2025, the MAU reached approximately 718.8 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The company has also established the world's leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 943.7 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of March 31, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to \"Human × Car × Home\" smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2024, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the sixth year in a row.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"1332","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1749124808"},"common":null}